# The upstream nolabs-ai/nono `main` commit that `integration` is rebuilt on, by
# .github/integration/rebuild: one line, the full 40-hex sha. Upstream moving does not move
# `integration`; this line does.
#
# Each day rebuild-integration.yml tries upstream `main`'s tip. When every topic branch in
# `topics` merges onto it in order, it opens or updates one pull request, labelled
# `integration-upstream`, that changes only this line; merging it rebuilds on the new pin. When
# one does not merge, it opens or updates an issue with that label naming the topic branch and
# its conflicting files, and changes nothing.
#
# A line that is not one 40-hex sha, or a commit not on upstream `main`, stops the rebuild.
